{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/54453-best-2e-2-5e-lunar-fan-reworkings","id":54453,"title":"Best 2E-2.5e Lunar fan reworkings?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-20T20:43:19-08:00","id":54453,"title":"Best 2E-2.5e Lunar fan reworkings?","content":"There were the Terrifying ARtent Witches and Goldencats 2E reworking of the lunar rules, but were there many other complete or more or less complete stabs at it? anyone have any suggestions of which ones they thought were the best?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-20T23:10:44-08:00","id":54502,"title":"","content":"Huh, never heard of Goldencat's before. *Googles, reads through.* And now I know why.<br /> <br /> It's mechanics are horribly, horribly done.<br /> <br /> First warning bells started going off in the section on building animal with mutations. No biggie, that's what Revlid did for his mutations rewrite, and got used for TAW's right? Well, Revlid never made these mutations:<br /> <b>Afflictions</b><br /> Allure - Adds +1 to Charisma and Appearance or +1 to Manipulation.<br /> Cunning - Adds +1 to Perception and Intelligence or +1 to Wits.<br /> Force - Adds +2 to Strength<br /> Might - Adds +1 to Strength and Stamina or +1 to Dexterity.<br /> <br /> And yes, you can make those count towards your die cap. It... pretty much went downhill from there. Their was the weird decision to penalize the hell out of Lunars for learning MA. It still has the Fury/Gift one-true build issues. The excellencies are weird, and not in a good way. No I(A)M equivalent, in fact no excellencies that go past action length. Their also just plain hard to understand, since it seems like the author left out the phrase 'to successes', so the only way to intuit what the thing does is the sections about converting successes in the damage rolls. The capstone ability turns the 1st and 2nd excellencies into anima effects, which does... what exactly? Note everything is auto combo'd in this rewrite.<br /> <br /> And then their are the charms themselves. It here that the fact this is an edition lift of a 1e project becomes very apparent. Odd mentions of brawl do that. And I hope the +3 'bonus' to Speed is another 1eism (yes, that's applied to your weapon). Beyond that, there are insane die pool inflation weapons (a Accuracy +10 weapon is easy to do), HLs for ammunition, the ability to not use virtue channels when using them for one willpower on the DBT equivalent.... And all this? A cursory reading. I gave up on this rewrite after I saw the Appearance charm that lets you use Appearance in place of Charisma or Manipulation in dice pools. Which is actually worse than it sounds, because one of the anima effect adds dice to die pools that use apperance.<br /> <br /> In summary, it's clumsy written to the point understanding it is difficult, the mechanics are horribad, and I honestly just don't like some of the design choices it made (form lock, MA penalization). The last I might have given a pass for if the charms had been usable. They aren't. Canon Lunars are considerably more playable then these guys.<br /> <br /> (If you want to see the Silver Masks rewrite for your selves, <a href=\"http://exalted.xi.co.nz/wiki/SilverMasks\" target=\"_blank\">here's the link.</a>)<br /> <br /> Consider my recommendation thoroughly given to the TAW's. They have their problems, but their mechanically sound by this point, and cool powers are fun. That said, a more standard take on Lunars would be nice to have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/963-kylar","name":"Kylar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar963_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T02:35:41-08:00","id":54547,"title":"","content":"None of the Lunar rewrites were very good. They needed some errata, not a complete thematic straightjacketing and new Charms.<br /> <br /> What are you looking for specifically? I only ask because I have what amounts to 'errata' as I actually am still playing a Lunar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/889-dayen","name":"Dayen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T02:46:51-08:00","id":54552,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dayen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/54453-best-2e-2-5e-lunar-fan-reworkings?p=54547#post54547\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">None of the Lunar rewrites were very good. They needed some errata, not a complete thematic straightjacketing and new Charms.</div> </div> </div> </div>Please don't tout your opinion as objective fact. Especially <i>this</i> one, because are you <i>trying</i> to start another twelve-page forum brawl?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are no problems, only plothooks.<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P2AuLM6D1Et9mWQVJp-ugWujFJhTi2VwQBtOazOW1Mg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Terrifying Argent Witches Hub</a><br /> <i>Originally posted by </i><b><i>Dex Davican</i></b><br /> I need them for my collection: <i>Enormous Gonads of 2012: A Retrospective.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/920-imrix","name":"Imrix","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T03:12:38-08:00","id":54562,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Imrix</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/54453-best-2e-2-5e-lunar-fan-reworkings?p=54552#post54552\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Please don't tout your opinion as objective fact. Especially <i>this</i> one, because are you <i>trying</i> to start another twelve-page forum brawl?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, asking for a fight would be pointing out that significant portions of the work were stolen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/889-dayen","name":"Dayen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar889_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T03:27:04-08:00","id":54573,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dayen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/54453-best-2e-2-5e-lunar-fan-reworkings?p=54562#post54562\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, asking for a fight would be pointing out that significant portions of the work were stolen.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh really. Care to name names? Because I can think of around three or so that derive a good chunk of their mechanics from other charms. Maybe as many as five or ten if you include things like Join Battle Rollers and Ox Bodies. <i>Out of around 300 charms.</i><br /> <br /> So kindly shut up and stop misrepresenting something you don't like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/963-kylar","name":"Kylar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar963_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T04:30:13-08:00","id":54597,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dayen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/54453-best-2e-2-5e-lunar-fan-reworkings?p=54562#post54562\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, asking for a fight would be pointing out that significant portions of the work were stolen.</div> </div> </div> </div>1: I was referring to how Lunar Threads tend to turn out in this community, particularly the &quot;Lunars aren't broken/yes they are and here's why/your reasons are bad and you should feel bad&quot; arguments. Can we not have another of those?<br /> <br /> 2: Yes, a few TAW Charms are reskinned Infernal Charms. I'm not going to compare the entire TAW and Infernal charmsets looking for specifics, but I'd bet money it is well less than a dozen, out of just shy of <i>three hundred</i> TAW Charms. That is not 'significant portions' by any measure.<br /> <br /> 3: Of the Charms that are 'stolen', all have seen reflavourings and replacing in the tree. Most have seen at least some mechanical alteration. There is a limit to how much effort it is reasonable to expect a fan project to expend in order to make its mechanics distinct.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are no problems, only plothooks.<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P2AuLM6D1Et9mWQVJp-ugWujFJhTi2VwQBtOazOW1Mg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Terrifying Argent Witches Hub</a><br /> <i>Originally posted by </i><b><i>Dex Davican</i></b><br /> I need them for my collection: <i>Enormous Gonads of 2012: A Retrospective.</i>","edited":{"userid":920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/920-imrix","user":"Imrix","date":". 01-21-2014, 09:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/920-imrix","name":"Imrix","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T10:45:28-08:00","id":54761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dayen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/54453-best-2e-2-5e-lunar-fan-reworkings?p=54562#post54562\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No, asking for a fight would be pointing out that significant portions of the work were stolen.</div> </div> </div> </div>You appear to be baiting people. Stop that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kylar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/54453-best-2e-2-5e-lunar-fan-reworkings?p=54573#post54573\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So kindly shut up and stop misrepresenting something you don't like.</div> </div> </div> </div>Use your report button.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-21T12:30:55-08:00","id":54824,"title":"","content":"TAW, in my opinion. Of the ones I've seen, it's great mechanically and, while it's got it's flaws, it's still pretty entertaining to read. That said, it's my opinion, and yours may well differ. Still, TAW's at least worth checking out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/800-fenrir666","name":"Fenrir666","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"300"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T05:39:03-08:00","id":55390,"title":"","content":"TAW would be my vote. It's got plenty of cool toys and is as mechanically sound as most things are in 2.5E. Only big issue I've seen in play is the sheer amount of legwork required to build all the different animals you'll need. Well, that and some holes in the charm set, but those are easily filled if you allow select cannon charms to be taken as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1218-taejix","name":"Taejix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T07:49:44-08:00","id":55441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taejix</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/54453-best-2e-2-5e-lunar-fan-reworkings?p=55390#post55390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">TAW would be my vote. It's got plenty of cool toys and is as mechanically sound as most things are in 2.5E. Only big issue I've seen in play is the sheer amount of legwork required to build all the different animals you'll need. Well, that and some holes in the charm set, but those are easily filled if you allow select cannon charms to be taken as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>Feel free to tell me about these holes, I may have a fix on my drawing board already~","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>There are no problems, only plothooks.<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1P2AuLM6D1Et9mWQVJp-ugWujFJhTi2VwQBtOazOW1Mg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Terrifying Argent Witches Hub</a><br /> <i>Originally posted by </i><b><i>Dex Davican</i></b><br /> I need them for my collection: <i>Enormous Gonads of 2012: A Retrospective.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/920-imrix","name":"Imrix","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T13:39:58-08:00","id":55655,"title":"","content":"Adamant Siaka did two rewrites, rather good ones at that; one near-total revamp of the canon charm-set, the other a complete revamp of the Alchemical charm-set into Lunar-equivalents. IIRC, he removed form-lock, replaced the tell, and created a lot of awesome knacks for hunting people's dreams and turning into things depicted via effigies. Balance might be questionable if you try to min-max that, but if you play it straight you get Lunars who are less &quot;The Animal Exalted&quot; and more &quot;The Shapeshifting Exalted&quot;. Also took a lot of the basic combat charms and tweaked them, adding odd side benefits like a small social bonus in social situations based on your presence being backed up by physical force, or the, ahem... Bedroom Applications... Of being strong, fast, flexible, and indefatigable.<br /> <br /> My favourite remains the TAW though, for sheer comprehensiveness and flavour.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Aretii: &quot;As one of the players described it, 'After initiation, it was actually a relief seeing who had eyepatches or bandaged hands - you know what <i>they</i> sacrificed, instead of wondering what bits people cut out of their own souls to gain power.'&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/578-lord-sia","name":"Lord Sia","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"240"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T15:01:56-08:00","id":55724,"title":"","content":"Sadly, Adamant Siaka's fixes have been lost. I really liked the Alchemical Lunar charm-set. I wonder if there is any chance that they could repost it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-23T17:43:21-08:00","id":56468,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode